# Level 3 autopilot input. Copy to products.yaml and edit.
#
# Each entry is one product. The autopilot loop rotates through them, shipping
# a fresh ad batch per product every --interval.
#
# product_image is optional. If omitted, inputs/product.png is used.

- name: Matcha protein stick
  benefits: 30g plant protein, zero crash, tastes like dessert
  product_image: inputs/products/matcha.png

- name: Hydration drops
  benefits: 2x electrolytes of the leading sports drink, zero sugar, real lemon
  product_image: inputs/products/drops.png

- name: Sleep gummies
  benefits: melatonin-free, L-theanine + magnesium glycinate, wake without grogginess
  product_image: inputs/products/sleep.png
